    "content" : "Consider a target at (ˆτ,v,θˆ ), where τˆ denotes the delay corresponding to the target range, vˆ is the Doppler frequency of the target and θ ∈ [−π2, π2] represents the direction angle of the target. Then, the received signal can be represented by"
